+## Failed session initialization
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, the orchestrator awaits `onError(session, error)` and then `afterSession(session)` before rejecting with that same error (provided those hooks complete normally); both hooks receive the original session, user-input and model processing have not started, and cleanup must handle partial initialization using allocation state maintained by the deployer rather than assuming setup completed ([validated by: reports and cleans up a failed beforeSession before rejecting with the original error](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L8)).
+
